# Who must review what.
#
# This file is the enforcement half of the "hard rules" in CONTRIBUTING.md. GitHub requires the
# listed owners' approval on any PR touching a matched path, provided branch protection on `main`
# has "Require review from Code Owners" enabled — the file alone does nothing.
#
# TODO when the organization exists: replace the individual handle with teams, so review does not
# depend on one person being available. Suggested teams:
#     @<org>/legal-review     for logic/ and data/  (needs GOÄ + legal competence, not just code)
#     @<org>/engine           for apps/engine/
#     @<org>/web              for apps/web/ and packages/ui/
# Owners must have write access to the repository or the rule is silently ignored.

# Default owner for anything not matched below.
*                               @oussamakhadraoui

